cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ForkSploit in academic work or a security report, please cite it as below."
title: "ForkSploit — audit/offensive platform for EVM smart contracts"
abstract: >-
  ForkSploit is an audit/offensive platform for EVM smart contracts. It
  discovers attack surfaces and proves exploitability by executing the exploit
  against real chain state and moving recovered funds to a recovery wallet.
  Built and verified for Ethereum (ETH) and Ethereum Classic (ETC), on both
  testnet and mainnet, for native currency and ERC tokens.
type: software
